Readplace for Android keeps the articles you save in one place to read. Share a link from any app to save it, and choose the readlists it goes into. Your reading list shows To Read and Read, and your readlists sit beside them. Open an article to read it in the app, highlight passages and add notes, and let Next Read take you to the next one. When a site won't let Readplace in, the app copies the page from your phone, so the article is still saved.
